        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>八、蒸馏操作 九、质量守恒定律验证</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"宋体\", serif;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 22px 30px 40px 30px;\n    background: #fff;\n    color: #000;\n    max-width: 560px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  h2.section {\n    color: #d81c2b;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    text-align: center;\n    border-top: 2px solid #d81c2b;\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #d81c2b;\n    padding: 4px 0;\n    margin: 14px 0 10px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .ans {\n    color: #1a3fd0;\n    border: 1px solid #d81c2b;\n    padding: 0 6px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"楷体\", serif;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n  .ansu {\n    color: #1a3fd0;\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"楷体\", serif;\n  }\n  p.line {\n    margin: 4px 0;\n  }\n  .indent {\n    margin-left: 22px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    color: #666;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 2px;\n    background: #fafafa;\n  }\n  .fig-distill {\n    width: 300px;\n    height: 105px;\n    margin: 6px auto 10px auto;\n  }\n  .exp-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    margin: 8px 0 2px 0;\n  }\n  .exp-item {\n    width: 118px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .exp-item .placeholder {\n    width: 118px;\n    height: 92px;\n  }\n  .exp-label {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n  }\n  .footer {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    margin-top: 26px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<h2 class=\"section\">八、蒸馏操作</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"placeholder fig-distill\">[Diagram: 蒸馏装置示意图，含\"自来水\"\"碎瓷片\"标注，居中]</figure>\n\n<p class=\"line\">1.蒸馏是利用液体的 <span class=\"ans\">沸点</span> 不同，分离液体混合物。</p>\n<p class=\"line\">2.碎瓷片的作用： <span class=\"ans\">防止液体暴沸</span> 。</p>\n<p class=\"line\">3.冷凝水 <span class=\"ansu\">下端口</span> 进，<span class=\"ansu\">上端口</span> 出，以使冷凝管中充满冷水。</p>\n<p class=\"line\">4.开始馏出的液体为 <span class=\"ans\">低沸点的杂质</span> ，应当去除。</p>\n<p class=\"line\">5.简易蒸馏装置中长导管的作用是 <span class=\"ans\">导气和冷凝</span> 。</p>\n\n<h2 class=\"section\">九、质量守恒定律验证</h2>\n\n<div class=\"exp-row\">\n  <div class=\"exp-item\">\n    <figure class=\"placeholder\">[Diagram: 托盘天平装置，标注\"玻璃管\"\"红磷\"\"细沙\"\"气球\"]</figure>\n    <div class=\"exp-label\">实验1</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"exp-item\">\n    <figure class=\"placeholder\">[Diagram: 托盘天平装置，标注\"CuSO₄溶液\"\"铁钉\"]</figure>\n    <div class=\"exp-label\">实验2</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"exp-item\">\n    <figure class=\"placeholder\">[Diagram: 托盘天平装置，标注\"稀盐酸\"\"Na₂CO₃粉末\"]</figure>\n    <div class=\"exp-label\">实验3</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"exp-item\">\n    <figure class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 镁条燃烧对比照片，标注\"镁条\"]</figure>\n    <div class=\"exp-label\">实验4</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"line\">1. 实验1的现象 <span class=\"ans\">白磷燃烧，产生大量白烟，气球先膨胀后变瘪</span> 。</p>\n<p class=\"line indent\">气球的作用是 <span class=\"ans\">缓冲压强，防止橡胶塞被冲开</span> 。</p>\n<p class=\"line indent\">锥形瓶底放一细砂的目的是<span class=\"ans\">防止瓶炸裂</span>[?]，反应后，天平是否平衡？<span class=\"ans\">是</span>。</p>\n<p class=\"line\">2. 实验 2 的现象是 <span class=\"ans\">铁钉表面出现红色固体，溶液由蓝色变浅绿色</span> ，</p>\n<p class=\"line indent\">化学方程式 <span class=\"ans\">CuSO₄+Fe＝FeSO₄+Fe</span> ，反应后，天平是否平衡？ <span class=\"ans\">是</span> 。</p>\n<p class=\"line\">3. 实验 3 结束后，天平是否平衡？<span class=\"ans\">否</span>，原因是 <span class=\"ans\">反应生成的CO₂逸散到空气中</span> 。</p>\n<p class=\"line indent\">如何改进装置以验证质量守恒定律 <span class=\"ans\">在密闭容器中进行实验</span> 。</p>\n<p class=\"line\">4. 实验 4：反应前称量镁条和石棉网质量，反应后称量石棉网和燃烧后得到的</p>\n<p class=\"line\">产物质量：</p>\n<p class=\"line indent\">①如果测得反应后质量比反应前质量大，原因 <span class=\"ans\">增加了偶氧元素的质量</span> 。</p>\n<p class=\"line indent\">②如果测得反应后质量比反应前质量小，原因 <span class=\"ans\">镁条燃烧时形成白烟逸散到空气中</span> 。</p>\n\n<div class=\"footer\">6 / 13</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
